ria, ~12E).\n- 15:00-16:30: Walk back (45 min), Piazza Navona (free fountains, Bernini works).\n- 16:30-18:00: Campo de' Fiori, gelato (Gelateria del Teatro, ~4E).\n- 18:00-19:00: Return to Pantheon area.\n- 19:00+: Dinner (Trastevere walkable option like Tonnarello, ~15E) or relax.\n\nDaily Budget Breakdown Table\n| Item | Day 1 (Euros) | Day 2 (Euros) | Notes |\n|------|---------------|---------------|-------|\n| Entries | 18 | 20 | Colosseum combo[1]; Vatican Museums |\n| Meals/Breaks | 27 | 21 | Breakfast, lunch, aperitivo/gelato |\n| Total | 45 | 50 | Under 100E cap; excludes transport |\n\nImages:\nRome Colosseum Sunrise: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/colosseum\nVatican Museums Sistine: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/vatican\nTrevi Fountain Night: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/trevi\n\nIcons:\nwalking: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/geo-alt-fill.svg\nclock: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/clock.svg\neuro: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/currency-euro.svg\n\nQuick Actions\nBook Colosseum Tickets: https://colosseo.it/en/\nReserve Vatican Museums: https://www.museivaticani.va/content/museivaticani/en.html\nCheck Rome Walking Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Pantheon,+Rome/Colosseum,+Rome/@41.893,-12.477\n\nSources\nhttps://mamalovesrome.com/how-to-see-rome-2-days-itinerary/[1]\nhttps://www.girlwiththepassport.com/rome-2-day-itinerary/[2]\nhttps://teaspoonofadventure.com/2-days-in-rome/[3]", "raw": {"id": "c2061557-9232-4dee-85f6-1cf1f709bd86", "model": "sonar-pro", "created": 1771342874, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1141, "completion_tokens": 1115, "total_tokens": 2256, "search_context_size": "low", "cost": {"input_tokens_cost": 0.00342, "output_tokens_cost": 0.01673, "request_cost": 0.006, "total_cost": 0.02615}}, "citations": ["https://mamalovesrome.com/how-to-see-rome-2-days-itinerary/", "https://www.girlwiththepassport.com/rome-2-day-itinerary/", "https://teaspoonofadven