base, performance optimization report\n\nPHASE 3: BACKEND INTEGRATION (Weeks 7-14)\n\nWeek 7-9 (December 13 - January 2, 2025)\nMilestone 3 (January 2): API architecture and specifications finalized\nActivities: Design API endpoints, plan database schema, establish authentication framework, prepare integration documentation\nDeliverables: API specification document, database design, authentication architecture\n\nWeek 10-12 (January 3 - January 23, 2025)\nMilestone 4 (January 23): Core backend services deployed and tested\nActivities: Develop API endpoints, implement database operations, set up backend infrastructure, conduct API testing\nDeliverables: Functional API endpoints, database implementation, backend testing report\n\nWeek 13-15 (January 24 - February 13, 2025)\nMilestone 5 (February 13): Frontend-backend integration complete and functional\nActivities: Integrate frontend with backend services, test data flow, resolve integration issues, optimize communication\nDeliverables: Integrated system, integration testing report, resolved issue log\n\nPHASE 4: QA TESTING (Weeks 13-16)\n\nWeek 13-15 (January 24 - February 13, 2025)\nMilestone 5 (February 13): Feature testing complete, critical issues resolved\nActivities: Execute feature test cases, perform regression testing, document defects, verify fixes\nDeliverables: Feature test report, defect log, resolved issues\n\nWeek 16 (February 14 - February 15, 2025)\nMilestone 6 (February 15): End-to-end testing complete, app ready for launch\nActivities: Conduct end-to-end system testing, perform final smoke testing, validate all user workflows, prepare release notes\nDeliverables: End-to-end test report, release notes, launch readiness sign-off\n\n## Three-Week Milestone Summary Table\n\nMilestone | Date | Phase | Key Deliverable | Status Gate\n---|---|---|---|---\nMilestone 1 | November 21, 2024 | UI/UX Design | Requirements and initial designs approved | Proceed to detailed design\nMilestone 2 | December 12, 2024 