ick Actions\n\nSet up automatic transfers to direct your $310 monthly savings into a dedicated account around payday.[1] Use budgeting apps to track dining and miscellaneous spending in real time, triggering alerts when approaching category limits. Review streaming subscriptions this week and cancel at least two services you haven't used in 30 days.", "raw": {"id": "afa99a23-61d5-4ba7-9b8f-3b57282e16de", "model": "sonar-pro", "created": 1771343198, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1124, "completion_tokens": 425, "total_tokens": 1549, "search_context_size": "low", "cost": {"input_tokens_cost": 0.00337, "output_tokens_cost": 0.00638, "request_cost": 0.006, "total_cost": 0.01575}}, "citations": ["https://www.newrez.com/blog/self-help-articles/how-to-budget-your-money-in-2026/", "https://yieldfund.com/best-budget-ideas-2026-smart-strategies-for-saving/", "https://midpennbank.com/how-to-create-a-budget-in-2026-a-step-by-step-guide-for-financial-success/", "https://www.domainmoney.com/post/the-budgeting-guide-for-high-earners-in-2026", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n_7sYHwXriE", "https://getsqwire.com/family-financial-wellness-guide/", "https://www.forrester.com/bold/planning-guides/", "https://www.fidelity.com/learning-center/personal-finance/2026-money-trends"], "search_results": [{"title": "How to Budget Your Money in 2026 | Newrez", "url": "https://www.newrez.com/blog/self-help-articles/how-to-budget-your-money-in-2026/", "date": "2025-11-26", "last_updated": "2026-02-09", "snippet": "1. Define Your Goals · 2. Know Where You Stand · 3. Compare Income to Expenses · 4. Plan Ahead · 5. Budget for Emergencies · 6. Trim Where You Can · 7 ...", "source": "web"}, {"title": "Best budget ideas 2026: Smart strategies for saving - Yieldfund", "url": "https://yieldfund.com/best-budget-ideas-2026-smart-strategies-for-saving/", "date": "2025-12-22", "last_updated": "2026-02-17", "snippet": "Discover the best budget ideas for 2026. Learn how to track expenses, trim costs, and build a r