{"prompt_hash": "5b800ebe6dd6a6c7ebb5fe0ae38fa87639b8248ac04230368cdfaf114f455371", "text": "VLOOKUP Text-Number Mismatch Fix\nVLOOKUP fails with #N/A when the lookup value is text but the source table has numbers due to data type mismatch; fix it by either converting the lookup value to a number in the formula or standardizing the source table formats.\n\nExcel Data Setup Context\nThis guide assumes the lookup value (e.g., in cell A2) appears as a number but is text (green triangle indicator), while the source table's first column (e.g., B:B in another sheet) holds true numbers. Exact ranges like =VLOOKUP(A2, Sheet2!B:C, 2, FALSE) are used in examples.\n\nFormula-Based Fixes\nUse these modified VLOOKUP formulas to handle the text lookup value without changing source data:\n\nText to Number Conversion (Primary Fix):\n=VLOOKUP(VALUE(A2), Sheet2!B:C, 2, FALSE)\nThe VALUE function converts text \"4399\" to number 4399 for matching.[1][3]\n\nQuick Arithmetic Trick:\n=VLOOKUP(A2+0, Sheet2!B:C, 2, FALSE)\nAdding zero forces text-to-number conversion inline.[1]\n\nNumber to Text Conversion (If Source is Text, Reverse Scenario):\n=VLOOKUP(TEXT(A2, \"0\"), Sheet2!B:C, 2, FALSE)\nTEXT ensures number lookup matches text source.[3]\n\nTest Data Types First:\n=ISTEXT(A2) returns TRUE if lookup is text; =ISNUMBER(B9) checks source cell.[2]\n\nFormatting-Based Fixes\nStandardize source table or lookup column permanently:\n\nConvert Source Text to Numbers (If Needed):\n1. Select source column (e.g., Sheet2!B:B).\n2. Click green error triangle > Convert to Number.\nOr use Paste Special: Copy empty cell, select range, right-click > Paste Special > Add.[1][4][5]\n\nConvert Lookup Text to Numbers:\n1. Select lookup cells (e.g., A:A).\n2. Data tab > Text to Columns > Finish (triggers conversion).\nOr multiply by 1: Enter 1 in helper cell, copy, Paste Special > Multiply.[5]\n\nVerify Post-Fix:\nRecalculate with F9; green triangles disappear for true numbers.[4]\n\nVLOOKUP Troubleshooting Table\n\n| Issue Indicator | Test Formula | Formula Fix | Formatting Fix |\n|-----------------|--------------|-------------|----------------|\n| Green triangle on lookup | =ISTEXT(A2) | =VLOOKUP(VALUE(A2), table, col, FALSE) | Text to Columns > Finish |\n| #N/A despite visual match | =ISNUMBER(B9) | =VLOOKUP(A2+0, table, col, FALSE) | Error icon > Convert to Number |\n| Extra spaces suspected | =LEN(TRIM(A2)) vs =LEN(A2) | =VLOOKUP(TRIM(VALUE(A2)), table, col, FALSE) | =TRIM in helper column [4] |\n\nQuick Actions\nOfficial Microsoft VLOOKUP Guide: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/vlookup-function-0bbc8083-26fe-4963-8ab8-93a18ad188a1\nExcel Error Checking Toggle: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/convert-numbers-stored-as-text-to-numbers-in-excel-40105f2a-fe79-4477-a171-c5bad0f0a885\nMrExcel VLOOKUP Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRc2IGTMRWw", "raw": {"id": "7b43474b-221a-4cc0-8408-77acc6487930", "model": "sonar-pro", "created": 1771343303, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1101, "completion_tokens": 733, "total_tokens": 1834, "search_context_size": "low", "cost": {"input_tokens_cost": 0.0033, "output_tokens_cost": 0.01099, "request_cost": 0.006, "total_cost": 0.0203}}, "citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRc2IGTMRWw", "https://exceljet.net/formulas/vlookup-with-numbers-and-text", "https://community.dynamics.com/blogs/post/?postid=dc259f72-84b3-430e-895f-b63f1f5833a9", "https://www.ablebits.com/office-addins-blog/excel-vlookup-not-working/", "https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/convert-numbers-stored-as-text-to-numbers-in-excel-40105f2a-fe79-4477-a171-c5bad0f0a885", "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/questions/5208703/while-using-vlookup-and-conversion-to-number"], "search_results": [{"title": "Troubleshooting VLOOKUP When Numbers Stored as Text - YouTube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRc2IGTMRWw", "date": "2019-03-05", "last_updated": "2026-02-12", "snippet": "Microsoft Excel Tutorial: Troubleshooting Excel