{"prompt_hash": "f8ee65a28b33bec0fa8c12096b81966bf2ebc1e6dcd3f99b04ed065953c642a3", "text": "Music Player Interface for Echoes of Silence\n\nMusic Playback Design Context\nThis design describes a compact mobile-style music player screen for 'Echoes of Silence' by Lumina, featuring central album art, current progress at 1:24 of 3:45, play/pause button (paused state), active shuffle toggle, and volume at 70%. Layout prioritizes visual hierarchy: artwork dominates top, track info and controls center, progress and secondary controls bottom. Inspired by standard audio player layouts with gradient backgrounds for immersion.[1][2][3]\n\nAlbum Art and Playback Screen Layout\n- Album Art: 300x300px square placeholder centered at top, with soft radial gradient overlay (purple-blue tones for 'silence' theme).\n- Track Info: Below art - Title 'Echoes of Silence' (bold, 24pt), Artist 'Lumina' (italic, 16pt), centered.\n- Progress Bar: Horizontal seek bar (full width minus margins), filled to 1:24 position (33% of 3:45 total), with time labels '1:24' left / '3:45' right. Thumb draggable.\n- Play/Pause Control: Large central button below progress (paused icon: two vertical bars).\n- Shuffle Toggle: Right of play button, active (green highlight, shuffled icon).\n- Volume Slider: Right side, horizontal slider at 70% fill, with speaker icon.\n- Additional Controls: Skip previous/next buttons flanking play/pause; repeat toggle off (grayed).\n\nPlayback Controls Table\n| Control | State/Position | Description |\n|---------|----------------|-------------|\n| Progress Bar | 1:24 / 3:45 | Seekable slider with time labels, buffered fill to current position[3] |\n| Play/Pause | Paused | Icon button for toggle, central focus[1][3] |\n| Shuffle | Active | Toggle on (highlighted icon), randomizes queue[1] |\n| Volume | 70% | Slider with speaker icon, adjustable 0-100%[3] |\n| Skip Prev/Next | Default | Flanking icons for track navigation[3] |\n| Album Art | Placeholder | Square image, tappable for full view[1][2] |\n\nVisual Assets\nImages:\nMusic Album Cover: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/music-silence\nPlayer Screen Mockup: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/music-player-ui\nIcons:\nplay-pause: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/pause-fill.svg\nshuffle: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/shuffle.svg\nvolume: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/volume-up-fill.svg\n\nQuick Actions\nAction: [Button: View Figma UI Kit] https://www.figma.com/community/file/896690537117411701/music-player-ui-kit\nAction: [Button: Watch Design Tutorial] https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5Bil9fZuus\n\nSources\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5Bil9fZuus[1]\nhttps://uizard.io/templates/mobile-app-templates/music-player-mobile-app/[2]\nhttps://www.newskit.co.uk/components/audio-player/[3]", "raw": {"id": "82415c0a-1347-4978-83f3-9d1df4845c3e", "model": "sonar-pro", "created": 1771343620, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1126, "completion_tokens": 691, "total_tokens": 1817, "search_context_size": "low", "cost": {"input_tokens_cost": 0.00338, "output_tokens_cost": 0.01037, "request_cost": 0.006, "total_cost": 0.01974}}, "citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5Bil9fZuus", "https://uizard.io/templates/mobile-app-templates/music-player-mobile-app/", "https://www.newskit.co.uk/components/audio-player/", "https://dribbble.com/tags/music-player", "https://www.figma.com/community/file/896690537117411701/music-player-ui-kit", "https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/music-player-ui", "https://www.framer.com/marketplace/components/tags/music/"], "search_results": [{"title": "Music Player Mobile App UI Design in Figma + Mobbin - YouTube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5Bil9fZuus", "date": "2025-11-05", "last_updated": "2026-02-16", "snippet": "Splash Screen · Home Screen · Song & Playlist Details Screen · Audio Player Screen · Song Lyrics Screen · Library Screen · Profile Screen.", "source": "web"}, {"title": "Mus