{"prompt_hash": "74108f18f168edcb5bdbad20f084247826522c31d94177ad85461640904929e6", "text": "Video Player Dashboard Design for Deep Sea Documentary\n\nCurrent Playback Context\nThe dashboard centers on playback of 'Nature Documentary: The Deep Sea' at 1080p with English subtitles active. Skip Intro button displays at 02:15 timestamp as a semi-transparent overlay in the lower third of the video area. Next Episode button appears as a persistent pill-shaped overlay in the upper right during playback. Settings gear icon sits in the top right for quality selection (e.g., toggle 1080p/720p/480p).\n\nDashboard Layout Specification\nMain layout uses a full-bleed video container (90% screen height) with overlay controls fading in on hover/pause. Progress bar spans bottom 8% with current time (e.g., 02:15 / 45:30), scrubber, and volume slider. Centered play/pause icon (64px) for primary interaction. Subtitles toggle visible below progress bar when enabled.\n\nKey Overlay Elements Positions:\n- Skip Intro: Bottom center, white text on blue gradient background, appears 02:15-02:45.\n- Next Episode: Top right corner, rounded button with arrow icon, auto-hides after 5s inactivity.\n- Settings Gear: Top right, expands popover with quality selector dropdown and subtitle language picker.\n\nControl Layout Table\n| Element | Position | Behavior | Size/Style |\n|---------|----------|----------|------------|\n| Video Canvas | Full width, 90vh | 16:9 aspect, 1080p stream | Black background fallback |\n| Progress Bar | Bottom 8% | Scrubbable, thumbnails on hover | Thin white track, blue fill |\n| Play/Pause | Screen center on pause | Pulse animation | 64px circle icon |\n| Skip Intro | Lower third center | Timed show 02:15 mark | 200x60px pill, 80% opacity |\n| Next Episode | Top right 20px margin | Persistent on play | 140x50px button, glow effect |\n| Settings Gear | Top right 10px margin | Click popover | 32px icon, hover scale 1.2 |\n| Volume Slider | Bottom right | Mute toggle | 120px horizontal |\n| Subtitles | Below progress | English active badge | Toggle icon + language text |\n\nPlayback UI Flow\n1. Idle: Minimal overlays (progress + center play).\n2. Active: Full controls fade in (3s timer).\n3. Skip Intro triggers at 02:15, auto-advances 90s on click.\n4. Settings popover: Quality options in grid (1080p selected), subtitles on/off.\n5. Next Episode queues seamless transition to 'Deep Sea Episode 2'.\n\nVisual Assets for Implementation\nImages:\nDeep Sea Documentary Thumbnail: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/deepsea,ocean\nStreaming Player Mockup: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/videoplayer,dashboard\nControl Overlay Example: https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/media_controls,ui\n\nIcons:\nPlay Button: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/play-fill.svg\nSettings Gear: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/gear-fill.svg\nSkip Forward: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/skip-forward-fill.svg\n\nQuick Actions\nPrototype in Figma: https://www.figma.com/community/file/1099352945401989333/movie-streaming-dashboard\nView Streaming UI Examples: https://saasinterface.com/pages/video-player/\nExplore Dribbble Inspirations: https://dribbble.com/search/video-player-dashboard\n\nSources\nhttps://support.video.ibm.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005508629-Video-Streaming-Dashboard-Player-Settings[1]\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2qYNGzwiedI[2]\nhttps://saasinterface.com/pages/video-player/[3]\nhttps://dribbble.com/search/video-player-dashboard[5]", "raw": {"id": "6a1b2e9b-c250-4ed1-8c29-d66619fbbd89", "model": "sonar-pro", "created": 1771343637, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1128, "completion_tokens": 833, "total_tokens": 1961, "search_context_size": "low", "cost": {"input_tokens_cost": 0.00338, "output_tokens_cost": 0.0125, "request_cost": 0.006, "total_cost": 0.02188}}, "citations": ["https://support.video.ibm.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005508629-Video-Streaming-Dashboard-Player-Settings", "https