rview_text\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"overview_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Overview\",\n          \"variant\": \"h2\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"overview_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"This itinerary balances interactive technology experiences, anime-related attractions, and museum visits suitable for 8-10 year olds during early summer (June). The plan assumes moderate walking tolerance for children, access to Tokyo's efficient train system, and pre-booking of popular attractions. Daily costs estimate USD 250-400 per family including meals, transit, and attractions.\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"context_section\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"context_title\",\n            \"context_list\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"context_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Context and Assumptions\",\n          \"variant\": \"h2\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"context_list\",\n          \"component\": \"List\",\n          \"direction\": \"vertical\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"ctx_1\",\n            \"ctx_2\",\n            \"ctx_3\",\n            \"ctx_4\",\n            \"ctx_5\",\n            \"ctx_6\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ctx_1\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"• Family staying in a central location (Shinjuku, Shibuya, or Ueno recommended).\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ctx_2\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"• Children comfortable with 2-3 hours of walking daily with rest breaks.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ctx_3\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"• Willingness to book popular attractions 1-2 weeks in advance.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ctx_4\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"• Use of Suica/Pasmo cards for transit efficiency.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ctx_5\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"• Early June weather: warm (75-80°F), possible rain; plan indoor activities accordingly.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ctx_6\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"• Budget includes meals at casual/mid-range restaurants, not fine dining.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"itinerary_section\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"itinerary_title\",\n            \"days_tabs\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"itinerary_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Day-by-Day Itinerary\",\n          \"variant\": \"h2\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"days_tabs\",\n          \"component\": \"Tabs\",\n          \"tabs\": [\n            {\n              \"title\": \"Day 1\",\n              \"child\": \"day1_content\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"title\": \"Day 2\",\n              \"child\": \"day2_content\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"title\": \"Day 3\",\n              \"child\": \"day3_content\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"title\": \"Day 4\",\n              \"child\": \"day4_content\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"title\": \"Day 5\",\n              \"child\": \"day5_content\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"day1_content\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"d1_header\",\n            \"d1_morning_title\",\n            \"d1_morning_text\",\n            \"d1_afternoon_title\",\n            \"d1_afternoon_text\",\n            \"d1_evening_title\",\n            \"d1_evening_text\",\n            \"d1_divider\",\n            \"d1_stats\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_header\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Modern Tokyo & Anime Culture (Harajuku, Shibuya, Omotesando)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_morning_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Morning (8:00 AM - 12:00 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_morning_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Start at Yoyogi Park near Harajuku station. Walk through the park to reach Meiji Jingu Shrine, where children can participate in the water purification ritual. The shrine grounds are peaceful and suitable for families. Grab coffee at a nearby cafe.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_afternoon_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Afternoon (1:00 PM - 5:00 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_afternoon_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Head to Takeshita Street in Harajuku, famous for youth culture and anime-related shops. Children aged 8-10 typically enjoy browsing anime merchandise, character goods, and quirky fashion stores. For lunch, cook okonomiyaki (Japanese savory pancakes) together at Sakura-tei, which offers an interactive dining experience. Reserve ahead.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_evening_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Late Afternoon/Evening (5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_evening_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Explore Omotesando's upscale shopping district and visit Tokyu Plaza to see the famous mirrored escalator. End the day at Nezu Museum in Aoyama, open until 5 PM. For dinner, book tonkatsu at Butagumi or choose casual ramen nearby.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_divider\",\n          \"component\": \"Divider\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d1_stats\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Estimated Cost: USD 280-350 | Neighborhood: Harajuku, Shibuya, Aoyama\",\n          \"variant\": \"caption\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"day2_content\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"d2_header\",\n            \"d2_morning_title\",\n            \"d2_morning_text\",\n            \"d2_lunch_title\",\n            \"d2_lunch_text\",\n            \"d2_afternoon_title\",\n            \"d2_afternoon_text\",\n            \"d2_evening_title\",\n            \"d2_evening_text\",\n            \"d2_divider\",\n            \"d2_stats\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_header\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Technology & Interactive Art (Odaiba, Ginza)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_morning_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Morning (8:00 AM - 12:00 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_morning_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Take the train to Odaiba. Visit teamLab Planets, an immersive digital art installation specifically designed for interactive engagement. Children can walk through light-based exhibits, digital gardens, and interactive installations. Book tickets in advance online.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_lunch_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Lunch (12:30 PM - 1:30 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_lunch_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Eat at Odaiba's waterfront dining area or nearby malls.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_afternoon_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Afternoon (2:00 PM - 5:00 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_afternoon_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Visit Miraikan (National Museum of Science and Innovation), featuring hands-on exhibits, robotics demonstrations, and interactive technology displays. Children can explore space exhibits, digital technology zones, and engineering concepts.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_evening_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Evening (5:30 PM - 8:30 PM)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_evening_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Return to Ginza for dinner. Browse Ginza's shopping streets or visit the Ginza district's casual dining options. If energy permits, explore anime/manga shops in nearby Akihabara.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_divider\",\n          \"component\": \"Divider\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d2_stats\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Estimated Cost: USD 300-400 | Neighborhood: Odaiba, Ginza, Akihabara\",\n          \"variant\": \"caption\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"day3_content\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"d3_header\",\n            \"d3_morning_title\",\n            \"d3_morning_text\",\n            \"d3_lunch_title\",\n            \"d3_lunch_text\",\n            \"d3_afternoon_title\",\n            \"d3_afternoon_text\",\n            \"d3_evening_title\",\n            \"d3_evening_text\",\n            \"d3_divider\",\n            \"d3_stats\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d3_header\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Aquariums & Cultural Museums (Asakusa, Ueno)\",\n       