 [\n            \"name-label\",\n            \"name-value\"\n          ],\n          \"align\": \"center\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"name-label\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Name: \",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"name-value\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Kaito \\\"Ghost\\\" Ishikawa\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"age-row\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"age-label\",\n            \"age-value\"\n          ],\n          \"align\": \"center\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"age-label\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Age: \",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"age-value\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"24\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"occupation-row\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"occupation-label\",\n            \"occupation-value\"\n          ],\n          \"align\": \"center\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"occupation-label\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Occupation: \",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"occupation-value\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Freelance Data Courier in Neo-Tokyo\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"phys-desc-header\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Physical Description\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"phys-desc-body\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Kaito stands at a lean 170 cm, a wiry frame honed by countless hours navigating Neo-Tokyo's crowded alleyways and rooftops. His short, dark hair is often slicked back with sweat and rain, framing a sharp, angular face dominated by piercing, dark brown eyes that constantly dart, scanning his surroundings. A faint, jagged scar runs from his left temple down to his cheekbone, a memento from a botched data retrieval. He typically wears a worn, reinforced trench coat over dark, utilitarian clothing, pockets bulging with various data chips and tools. His movements are fluid, almost silent, a necessity for his line of work, often cloaked in the shadows of the city's neon glow.\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cyber-header\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Unique Cybernetic Enhancement\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cyber-card\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"cyber-col\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cyber-col\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"cyber-name\",\n            \"cyber-desc\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cyber-name\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Neural Synapse Accelerator (NSA)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cyber-desc\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Implanted directly into his cerebral cortex, the NSA is a highly illegal, experimental neural processor that drastically speeds up Kaito's cognitive functions and reaction times for short bursts. When activated, his perception of time slows, allowing him to process vast amounts of data, analyze complex situations, or react to threats with superhuman speed. It's not a combat augmentation in the traditional sense, but it gives him an unparalleled edge in data decryption, system bypassing, and evasive maneuvers during high-stakes runs. The drawback: prolonged use leads to severe neural strain, disorientation, and a crushing 'crash' afterwards, often accompanied by intense migraines, temporary sensory overload, and even memory gaps. It's a high-risk, high-reward tool he uses sparingly, knowing each activation brings him closer to its irreversible neurological tolls.\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"backstory-header\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Backstory\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"backstory-col\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"backstory-p1\",\n            \"backstory-p2\",\n            \"backstory-p3\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"backstory-p1\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Kaito grew up in the shadow of Neo-Tokyo's towering arcologies, a digital native from the grimy lower sectors where data streams were as vital as air. His family, burdened by mounting medical debt from his younger sister's rare genetic illness, pushed him towards a corporate track, but Kaito found the structured life stifling. Instead, he gravitated to the underground, honing his natural aptitude for data manipulation and urban navigation. He started small, running encrypted messages for local fixers, quickly earning the moniker \\\"Ghost\\\" for his uncanny ability to disappear into the city's labyrinthine networks and physical spaces, always delivering.\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"backstory-p2\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"His downfall began with a seemingly routine job: delivering a package of sensitive corporate schematics across the city. The client was a mid-tier yakuza lieutenant, 'Ryu,' from the notorious Crimson Coil Syndicate. Kaito, confident in his skills, accepted without his usual rigorous vetting, seduced by the exorbitant pay. Mid-delivery, he was ambushed by a rival gang, the 'Neon Serpents,' who had been tipped off to the high-value data. Kaito managed to escape with the package, but not before a brutal chase through the Shinjuku slums that ended with the package being severely damaged – data corrupted beyond retrieval.\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"backstory-p3\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Ryu was not pleased. The schematics were crucial to a planned corporate takeover, and their loss cost the Crimson Coil millions in potential profits and street cred. Instead of simply eliminating Kaito, Ryu, impressed by the courier's tenacity in escaping, offered a 'deal.' Kaito would work off the colossal debt – estimated at 50 million yen – through high-risk, off-the-books data runs and information gathering, directly for the syndicate. His life, and the safety of his remaining family, now hung by a thread, contingent on his unwavering service to the Crimson Coil. Every delivery, every hack, every whisper of information he gathers isn't just a job; it's another chip away at a debt that feels like a digital shackle, binding him to the city's darkest corners.\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"version\": \"v0.9\"\n  }\n]", "raw": {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "[\n  {\n    \"createSurface\": {\n      \"surfaceId\": \"character-profile-surface\",\n      \"catalogId\": \"https://genui.local/specification/v0_9/standard_catalog.json\",\n      \"theme\": {\n        \"primaryColor\": \"#00FFFF\",\n        \"agentDisplayName\": \"Character Generator\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"version\": \"v0.9\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"updateComponents\": {\n      \"surfaceId\": \"character-profile-surface\",\n      \"components\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"root\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"assumptions-text\",\n            \"header-text\",\n            \"basic-i