r your family of four (2 adults, 2 minors under 18). The Colosseum, Roman Forum, and Palatine Hill are sold as a single 24-hour combination ticket. Your activity budget of €400 is sufficient for these main attractions, leaving a good amount for food experiences, other museums, or tours.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"comparison_title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\",\n          \"text\": \"Historical Site Comparison for a Family of Four\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"comparison_table\",\n          \"component\": \"List\",\n          \"direction\": \"vertical\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"table_header_row\",\n            \"colosseum_card\",\n            \"forum_card\",\n            \"pantheon_card\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"table_header_row\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"header_site_name\",\n            \"header_duration\",\n            \"header_suitability\",\n            \"header_cost\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"header_site_name\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Site Name\",\n          \"variant\": \"h5\",\n          \"weight\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"header_duration\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Visit Duration\",\n          \"variant\": \"h5\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"header_suitability\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Suitability for Kids (10 & 14)\",\n          \"variant\": \"h5\",\n          \"weight\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"header_cost\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Approx. Family Ticket Cost\",\n          \"variant\": \"h5\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_card\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"colosseum_content_col\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_content_col\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"colosseum_data_row\",\n            \"colosseum_action_button\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_data_row\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"align\": \"start\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"colosseum_site_name\",\n            \"colosseum_duration\",\n            \"colosseum_suitability\",\n            \"colosseum_cost\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_site_name\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Colosseum\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\",\n          \"weight\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_duration\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"2 - 3 hours\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_suitability\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"High: The grand scale and gladiator history are fascinating for all ages. The 14-year-old will appreciate the historical context, while the 10-year-old will be captivated by the iconic structure.\",\n          \"weight\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_cost\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"€44\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_action_button\",\n          \"component\": \"Button\",\n          \"child\": \"colosseum_button_text\",\n          \"action\": {\n            \"functionCall\": {\n              \"call\": \"openUrl\",\n              \"args\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://www.coopculture.it/en/products/ticket-colosseum-roman-forum-palatine_24h/\"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"colosseum_button_text\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Book Official Tickets\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_card\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"forum_content_col\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_content_col\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"forum_data_row\",\n            \"forum_action_button\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_data_row\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"align\": \"start\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"forum_site_name\",\n            \"forum_duration\",\n            \"forum_suitability\",\n            \"forum_cost\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_site_name\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Roman Forum & Palatine Hill\",\n          \"variant\": \"h4\",\n          \"weight\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_duration\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"2 - 3 hours\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_suitability\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Moderate to High: As a sprawling ruin, it requires more imagination. The 14-year-old history enthusiast will find it engaging; a good guide or app will be helpful for the 10-year-old.\",\n          \"weight\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_cost\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Included with Colosseum ticket\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"forum_action_button\",\n          \"component\": \"Button\",\n          \"child\": \"forum_button_text\",\n          \"action\": {\n            \"functionCall\": {\n              \"call\": \"openUrl\",\n              \"args\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://colosseo.it/en/area/roman-forum/\"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\"