ans stunning scenery but also larger crowds. It is advisable to start your day early to enjoy the main sites with fewer people. Wear comfortable walking shoes, as this itinerary involves exploring hilly, stone-paved streets. All locations are connected by scenic walks, eliminating the need for transport between sites.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_gallery_row\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"justify\": \"spaceAround\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"image_card_1\",\n            \"image_card_2\",\n            \"image_card_3\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_card_1\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"image_1\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_1\",\n          \"component\": \"Image\",\n          \"url\": \"../assets/r_000020_01_1_kiyomizu-dera_autumn.jpg\",\n          \"fit\": \"cover\",\n          \"accessibility\": {\n            \"label\": \"Kiyomizu-dera Temple in Autumn\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_card_2\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"image_2\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_2\",\n          \"component\": \"Image\",\n          \"url\": \"../assets/r_000020_01_2_ninenzaka_kyoto.jpg\",\n          \"fit\": \"cover\",\n          \"accessibility\": {\n            \"label\": \"Ninenzaka Sloped Street\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_card_3\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"image_3\",\n          \"weight\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"image_3\",\n          \"component\": \"Image\",\n          \"url\": \"../assets/r_000020_01_3_gion_night.jpg\",\n          \"fit\": \"cover\",\n          \"accessibility\": {\n            \"label\": \"Gion District at Night\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"itinerary_header\",\