ithmetic (July 26 - August 1)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week1-tasks\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"w1-task1\", \"w1-task2\", \"w1-task3\", \"w1-task4\", \"w1-task5\", \"w1-task6\"]\n        },\n        { \"id\": \"w1-task1\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Friday (90 min): Number Properties, Integers, Divisibility Rules.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w1-task2\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Saturday (3 hrs): Fractions, Decimals, Percentages, and Ratio/Proportion. Complete a large set of practice problems.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w1-task3\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Monday (90 min): Exponents and Roots.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w1-task4\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Tuesday (90 min): Rates and Work Problems.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w1-task5\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Wednesday (90 min): General review of all Arithmetic topics covered.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w1-task6\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Thursday (90 min): Take a 30-40 minute timed quiz on Arithmetic. Spend the remaining time reviewing every mistake.\" },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week2-details\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"week2-title\", \"week2-tasks\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week2-title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\",\n          \"text\": \"Week 2: Algebra (August 2 - August 8)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week2-tasks\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"w2-task1\", \"w2-task2\", \"w2-task3\", \"w2-task4\", \"w2-task5\", \"w2-task6\"]\n        },\n        { \"id\": \"w2-task1\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Friday (90 min): Operations with Algebraic Expressions, Rules of Exponents.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w2-task2\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Saturday (3 hrs): Solving Linear & Quadratic Equations, Systems of Equations, and Inequalities. Focus on word problems that translate to algebraic equations.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w2-task3\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Monday (90 min): Functions and their properties (f(x) notation, domain, range).\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w2-task4\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Tuesday (90 min): Advanced Word Problems (mixture, interest, etc.).\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w2-task5\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Wednesday (90 min): General review of all Algebra topics.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w2-task6\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Thursday (90 min): Take a 30-40 minute timed quiz on Algebra. Spend the remaining time on detailed error analysis.\" },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week3-details\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"week3-title\", \"week3-tasks\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week3-title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\",\n          \"text\": \"Week 3: Geometry (August 9 - August 15)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week3-tasks\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"w3-task1\", \"w3-task2\", \"w3-task3\", \"w3-task4\", \"w3-task5\", \"w3-task6\"]\n        },\n        { \"id\": \"w3-task1\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Friday (90 min): Lines, Angles, Triangles, and Quadrilaterals. Memorize key formulas.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w3-task2\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Saturday (3 hrs): Circles, Polygons, and 3D Figures (Cubes, Cylinders). Practice problems involving combined shapes.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w3-task3\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Monday (90 min): Coordinate Geometry (Slope, Intercepts, Distance Formula, Midpoint).\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w3-task4\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Tuesday (90 min): Mixed Geometry problem-solving session.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w3-task5\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Wednesday (90 min): General review of all Geometry topics and formulas.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w3-task6\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Thursday (90 min): Take a 30-40 minute timed quiz on Geometry. Review all mistakes and the underlying formulas.\" },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week4-details\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"week4-title\", \"week4-tasks\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week4-title\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\",\n          \"text\": \"Week 4: Data Analysis (August 16 - August 22)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week4-tasks\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"w4-task1\", \"w4-task2\", \"w4-task3\", \"w4-task4\", \"w4-task5\", \"w4-task6\"]\n        },\n        { \"id\": \"w4-task1\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Friday (90 min): Statistics (Mean, Median, Mode, Range).\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w4-task2\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Saturday (3 hrs): Advanced Statistics (Standard Deviation, Quartiles, Percentiles) and Probability.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w4-task3\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Monday (90 min): Combinatorics (Permutations and Combinations).\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w4-task4\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Tuesday (90 min): Data Interpretation (Graphs, Charts, Tables). Focus on reading and extracting information quickly.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w4-task5\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Wednesday (90 min): General review of all Data Analysis topics.\" },\n        { \"id\": \"w4-task6\", \"component\": \"Text\", \"text\": \"• Thursday (90 min): Take a 30-40 minute timed quiz on Data Analysis. Review errors thoroughly.\" },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"week5-details\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"children\": [\"week5-title\", \"week5-tasks\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"we