ommendations below adhere strictly to your budget cap of $1,500 USD and weight limit of 500g (body including battery). Prices listed are approximate body-only retail prices as of late 2023/early 2024.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"List\",\n          \"id\": \"criteria_list\",\n          \"direction\": \"vertical\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"criteria_weight\",\n            \"criteria_lens\",\n            \"criteria_ibis\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"id\": \"criteria_weight\",\n          \"text\": \"Weight: Includes battery and memory card to reflect real-world travel load.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"id\": \"criteria_lens\",\n          \"text\": \"Lens Ecosystem: \\\"Affordable\\\" is defined by the availability of third-party options (Sigma, Tamron) or a mature Micro Four Thirds market.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"id\": \"criteria_ibis\",\n          \"text\": \"IBIS: All selected models feature 5-axis in-body stabilization, essential for handheld travel shots in low light or video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"id\": \"recommended_models_heading\",\n          \"text\": \"Recommended Models\",\n          \"variant\": \"h3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"id\": \"model_cards_column\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"fuji_card\",\n            \"sony_card\",\n            \"om_card\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"id\": \"fuji_card\",\n          \"child\": \"fuji_card_content\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"id\": \"fuji_card_content\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"fuji_image\",\n            \"fuji_title\",\n            \"fuji_desc\",\n            \"fuji_button\"\n          ]\n      